title: "Days of Cover: a supply chain stress test"
abstract: "How long can you keep shipping if a supplier, port or route goes down, and what is the cheapest fix. A discrete-event simulation of a multi-tier supply network under disruption with time-to-survive and time-to-recover analysis."
